  unitName: Light Crystal
  unitId: 50364
  unitNumber: 433
  description: This magical creature is said to systemize and store all Light-related
    knowledge that Metal Units can hold within them. As Crystal Gods are far rarer
    than Metal Gods, there has been conflict over their existence until recent years
    due to few witness reports. After their existence had been proven, they were
    initially recorded as a subspecies of Metal Gods, but they were completely different
    creatures despite their similar appearance. It is said that Crystal Gods organize
    the records held within Metal Gods, then systemize and refine the information.
  summonDesc: Summoner, I shall give you power.<br>Use my knowledge well,<br>and
    lead the world for the better.
